Dialogue: 3,0:23:09.70,0:23:12.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}櫻花凋零  片片飛舞
Dialogue: 3,0:23:12.25,0:23:15.96,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我永遠在苦苦等待
Dialogue: 3,0:23:15.96,0:23:19.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}渴望得到你的溫暖
Dialogue: 3,0:23:20.17,0:23:22.92,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我最討厭流下眼淚
Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.92,0:23:26.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}生怕被人看出悲傷
Dialogue: 3,0:23:26.18,0:23:29.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}將它深深鎖在體內
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.35,0:23:30.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}快了，
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.89,0:23:33.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}櫻花凋零  片片飛舞
